{pad:meta title='Formulas in AsciiMath', about='Inline and set apart: a fraction with a root, a sum with its limits, a matrix and a function by cases, written as MathML.'/}
<p>The roots of {notation:math 'ax^2 + bx + c = 0'/} are</p>
{notation:math display='block'}x = (-b +- sqrt(b^2 - 4ac))/(2a){/notation:math}
{notation:math display='block'}sum_(i=1)^n i = (n(n+1))/2, quad [[a,b],[c,d]]^(-1) = 1/(ad-bc) [[d,-b],[-c,a]]{/notation:math}
{notation:math display='block'}|x| = {(x, if x >= 0),(-x, if x < 0):}{/notation:math}
